# Local index scope for codebase-memory itself.
#
# The repo is 1.4 GB, almost all of it vendored tree-sitter grammars, Rust
# target output and the built node_modules of the graph UI. None of it is
# useful to query, and indexing it would bury the source under generated code.

node_modules/
dist/
target/
Formula/
vendored/
test-infrastructure/
graph-ui/coverage/
graph-ui/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
*.wasm
*.rlib
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.o
*.rlib
docs/**/*.png
docs/**/*.jpg
docs/**/*.gif
docs/**/*.svg
